      "title": "A rider and its base policy have separate conditions",
      "text": "An accidental-death rider commonly requires a specified causal connection, a death within a stated interval after injury and compliance with exclusions and age limits. Carrier examples have different intervals. Do not replace the exam question’s stated interval with a memorized universal number.",
